description	"Sev'rance Tann

A separatist Dark Acolyte General, great force sense and commanding ability.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% Faster Swings
- Lightsaber (Purple/Cyan/Yellow Style)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect/Defense (3)
-- Disarms on hit
-- Saber Throw [CS1] (40 Damage)
-- 25% Increased Special Move Damage
-- Lower Damage Swings

^8Attributes:
- 20% Faster Hacking
- Blast Armor
- Rally
- Dexterity (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Stat Viewer
- Force Sense Immunity
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Health Regen Capped At 35

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (2)
- Pull (3) [CS2]
- Sense (3)
- Lightning (2)
- Grip (1)
- Team Energize (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Force Block (2)

^8Abilities:
- Enemy Scanner ^3[CS4]
- Dexterity Roll ^3[CS3]"